(7073096, 1075863, 94815, '<td valign="top">Explosive energy reminds me of "Blast" by Adolph Gottlieb. His was of a different era of threatened nuclear war. This is of a modern time of petulant personalities and narcissistic souls. 8</td>', 'Explosive energy reminds me of "Blast" by Adolph Gottlieb. His was of a different era of threatened nuclear war. This is of a modern time of petulant personalities and narcissistic souls. 8', '2013-07-17 21:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073098, 1075853, 76335, '<td valign="top">I do like how they consume the frame. Unnecessarily verbose title.</td>', 'I do like how they consume the frame. Unnecessarily verbose title.', '2013-07-17 21:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073101, 1075960, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful earthy pastels here.</td>', 'Beautiful earthy pastels here.', '2013-07-17 21:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073104, 1075273, 94815, '<td valign="top">Good eye squaring up the essentials and allowing the off-line pipe to provide essential imperfection. Tones and precision of details work to create a real vs abstract modernist nonobjective construct. The tension is surprisingly effective on repeated viewing. 8</td>', 'Good eye squaring up the essentials and allowing the off-line pipe to provide essential imperfection. Tones and precision of details work to create a real vs abstract modernist nonobjective construct. The tension is surprisingly effective on repeated viewing. 8', '2013-07-17 22:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073107, 1075881, 94815, '<td valign="top">Very emotive flows and color. The hard, nearly metallic tones are so absolutely modern and relevant. 7</td>', 'Very emotive flows and color. The hard, nearly metallic tones are so absolutely modern and relevant. 7', '2013-07-17 22:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073109, 1075836, 76335, '<td valign="top">Excellent. I''m reminded of a wonderful novella called Ghosts by César Aira.</td>', 'Excellent. I''m reminded of a wonderful novella called Ghosts by César Aira.', '2013-07-17 22:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073118, 1075923, 94815, '<td valign="top">Beautifully unstable and ambiguous. The title is sharp but slyly deceitful (does indeed look like a pawn) - your daughter no doubt (makes her the queen). The Sears &amp; Roebuck sign provides a hint of a parallel dimension from which she sprang. Whatever. The extra space in the foreground sets the stage for portentous events. 7</td>', 'Beautifully unstable and ambiguous. The title is sharp but slyly deceitful (does indeed look like a pawn) - your daughter no doubt (makes her the queen). The Sears & Roebuck sign provides a hint of a parallel dimension from which she sprang. Whatever. The extra space in the foreground sets the stage for portentous events. 7', '2013-07-17 22:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073122, 1075859, 94815, '<td valign="top">One of your best (if you are indeed the namesake of the 1960''s American sci-fi actor). This has an organic feel I find so satisfying and complete - an observation of life and immutable history that draws us in with the hope of finding something they have given up on. Otherwise light and tones are typically well done, etc. 9</td>', 'One of your best (if you are indeed the namesake of the 1960''s American sci-fi actor). This has an organic feel I find so satisfying and complete - an observation of life and immutable history that draws us in with the hope of finding something they have given up on. Otherwise light and tones are typically well done, etc. 9', '2013-07-17 22:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073143, 1075887, 94815, '<td valign="top">Quite nice - good interactions or not. Hardly an element that seems out of place or irrelevant. Could be a modern take  on Norman Rockwell except this is much better.</td>', 'Quite nice - good interactions or not. Hardly an element that seems out of place or irrelevant. Could be a modern take  on Norman Rockwell except this is much better.', '2013-07-17 22:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
