(7073337, 1075958, 113156, '<td valign="top">Splendid.</td>', 'Splendid.', '2013-07-18 09:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073338, 1075924, 12611, '<td valign="top">You have accomplished two things with this photo that I appreciated greatly in a second, longer viewing. <br/> <br/>1. You highlight the regal and still beastly beautiful nature of horses.<br/> <br/>2. Through use of composition, a black background, and light at the right spots to enhance detail, there is a lingering feel, and pleasing tonality especially in the spots on the horses face, where the pigment fails, and white gives way to pink nose and mouth flesh.</td>', 'You have accomplished two things with this photo that I appreciated greatly in a second, longer viewing.  1. You highlight the regal and still beastly beautiful nature of horses. 2. Through use of composition, a black background, and light at the right spots to enhance detail, there is a lingering feel, and pleasing tonality especially in the spots on the horses face, where the pigment fails, and white gives way to pink nose and mouth flesh.', '2013-07-18 09:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073339, 1075959, 12611, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of light, shape and blur to provide a light-hearted take on the essence of summer.</td>', 'Beautiful use of light, shape and blur to provide a light-hearted take on the essence of summer.', '2013-07-18 09:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073340, 1075899, 12611, '<td valign="top">Firstly, I have read some Shakespeare, and, although I am getting older and more foggy, as I seem to remember, it does not go well for the star-crossed lovers.<br/> <br/>Technically, the composition and concept is very well done, the sky tones and distortion are a bit off-putting. <br/> <br/>As a whole, your picture may have more hope that the lovers, and if it means anything, although they have different balloon and shirt preferences, they both love jeans and snazzy sneakers. Maybe they can build on that.</td>', 'Firstly, I have read some Shakespeare, and, although I am getting older and more foggy, as I seem to remember, it does not go well for the star-crossed lovers. Technically, the composition and concept is very well done, the sky tones and distortion are a bit off-putting.  As a whole, your picture may have more hope that the lovers, and if it means anything, although they have different balloon and shirt preferences, they both love jeans and snazzy sneakers. Maybe they can build on that.', '2013-07-18 09:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073342, 1075890, 100831, '<td valign="top">love the mood here.</td>', 'love the mood here.', '2013-07-18 09:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073345, 1075900, 100831, '<td valign="top">stand up and notice.... gotta love that curvy shadow...</td>', 'stand up and notice.... gotta love that curvy shadow...', '2013-07-18 09:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073346, 1075797, 100831, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and detail work.. this is just loverly.</td>', 'Beautiful color and detail work.. this is just loverly.', '2013-07-18 09:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073349, 1075861, 12611, '<td valign="top">I get an explosive, cinematic feel of loss and uncertainty. A journey, either life or some emotional turmoil, the title sets it up, the viewer gets to decide. <br/> <br/>Compositionally, there is already a great deal of distance behind the subject, so we are left to empathize with the pain already suffered, and we are left with uncertainty about the road ahead, but confident the way is narrow and must be faced alone.</td>', 'I get an explosive, cinematic feel of loss and uncertainty. A journey, either life or some emotional turmoil, the title sets it up, the viewer gets to decide.  Compositionally, there is already a great deal of distance behind the subject, so we are left to empathize with the pain already suffered, and we are left with uncertainty about the road ahead, but confident the way is narrow and must be faced alone.', '2013-07-18 10:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
