(7073367, 1075836, 12611, '<td valign="top">The figures in the windows(and on the stucco) do call to mind ghostly visages- certainly with an ominous feeling, that there is some presence here, possibly malevolent, possibly benign.<br/> <br/>What strikes me is the cat. It adds the detail and flavor, it is looking down, but I expect that it can see the souls.</td>', 'The figures in the windows(and on the stucco) do call to mind ghostly visages- certainly with an ominous feeling, that there is some presence here, possibly malevolent, possibly benign. What strikes me is the cat. It adds the detail and flavor, it is looking down, but I expect that it can see the souls.', '2013-07-18 11:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
