(7073370, 1075938, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the 90 degree rotation, the textures. <br/> <br/>Who would hang such a skull on the wall? There is something soulless about an animal skull, and the malevolent demonic quality of horns is present. I get the feeling of the end of life, and this is the waiting room outside Death''s office.</td>', 'I like the 90 degree rotation, the textures.  Who would hang such a skull on the wall? There is something soulless about an animal skull, and the malevolent demonic quality of horns is present. I get the feeling of the end of life, and this is the waiting room outside Death''s office.', '2013-07-18 11:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073372, 1075527, 165151, '<td valign="top">Like the contrast, dark sky, building, it all fits.</td>', 'Like the contrast, dark sky, building, it all fits.', '2013-07-18 11:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073373, 1075906, 12611, '<td valign="top">First struck by a terrific title, I had to step back from this one, take it in, observe it without focus, full of scratches the imperfections. <br/> <br/>I feel the warmth, the imbalance, the depth and the darkness. Copper, wood, hair, the intent, the mild and semi-sweet victories. We are all fighting the long and inevitable defeat, sunset after sunset.</td>', 'First struck by a terrific title, I had to step back from this one, take it in, observe it without focus, full of scratches the imperfections.  I feel the warmth, the imbalance, the depth and the darkness. Copper, wood, hair, the intent, the mild and semi-sweet victories. We are all fighting the long and inevitable defeat, sunset after sunset.', '2013-07-18 11:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073385, 1075898, 28427, '<td valign="top">Been coming back now several times to watch this work.<br/>I just can''t figure out what I''m looking at.  At first I thought a dog.  Nah, not a dog.  Then I thought a hand waving (elbow supported on the table, hand above the elbow and flat instead of up)... Nah, don''t think so either.<br/>At the right: a hand holding glasses? Man, this is one of images in which the viewer can release his/her own fantasy.  Just love it.</td>', 'Been coming back now several times to watch this work.I just can''t figure out what I''m looking at.  At first I thought a dog.  Nah, not a dog.  Then I thought a hand waving (elbow supported on the table, hand above the elbow and flat instead of up)... Nah, don''t think so either.At the right: a hand holding glasses? Man, this is one of images in which the viewer can release his/her own fantasy.  Just love it.', '2013-07-18 12:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073401, 1075271, 94815, '<td valign="top">Nice mix of fixed and transitory. Well timed comp. Good textures establish a properly flat plane with some tension provided by the diagonal boom of the shadow. voted earlier</td>', 'Nice mix of fixed and transitory. Well timed comp. Good textures establish a properly flat plane with some tension provided by the diagonal boom of the shadow. voted earlier', '2013-07-18 13:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073403, 1075861, 94815, '<td valign="top">This is a quite strong amalgam of static and moving elements - in reverse. The person moving seems static while the background moves. Yes we know how it''s done in photography but the knowledge doesn''t diminish the mind-bending effect. One minor gripe: the excessive blank space on the right dilutes the overall impact. Black is like a black hole - it pulls and works against the otherwise wonderful compositional effect.</td>', 'This is a quite strong amalgam of static and moving elements - in reverse. The person moving seems static while the background moves. Yes we know how it''s done in photography but the knowledge doesn''t diminish the mind-bending effect. One minor gripe: the excessive blank space on the right dilutes the overall impact. Black is like a black hole - it pulls and works against the otherwise wonderful compositional effect.', '2013-07-18 13:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073404, 1075863, 100831, '<td valign="top">abstract in motion.. love the light. (voted earlier)</td>', 'abstract in motion.. love the light. (voted earlier)', '2013-07-18 13:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073405, 1075149, 94815, '<td valign="top">The texture and tones of the skin and of course that eye are what this is all about. By placing that eye off center, you have provided a sense of imbalance I find disconcerting as if behind the half smile is a very complicated story. Penetrating character study. voted earlier</td>', 'The texture and tones of the skin and of course that eye are what this is all about. By placing that eye off center, you have provided a sense of imbalance I find disconcerting as if behind the half smile is a very complicated story. Penetrating character study. voted earlier', '2013-07-18 13:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
