(7073717, 1075950, 61396, '<td valign="top">Art of the Mundane: So you see the sunlight passing through the blinds and hitting the rug, you twist your head at a certain precise angle that only an artist can measure, you create an imaginary frame, and then you stop for a tiny moment. If you happen to have a camera at that tiny moment, then you can share your vision with others. Otherwise, it is yours forever to treasure.</td>', 'Art of the Mundane: So you see the sunlight passing through the blinds and hitting the rug, you twist your head at a certain precise angle that only an artist can measure, you create an imaginary frame, and then you stop for a tiny moment. If you happen to have a camera at that tiny moment, then you can share your vision with others. Otherwise, it is yours forever to treasure.', '2013-07-19 00:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
