(7076059, 1075899, 109227, '<td valign="top">I like the tones of this and the processing is really nice.  I am not fond of the "staged look" of it; that said, it could be a "surprise" set-up for the young lady??.  Fun shot.</td>', 'I like the tones of this and the processing is really nice.  I am not fond of the "staged look" of it; that said, it could be a "surprise" set-up for the young lady??.  Fun shot.', '2013-07-23 17:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
