(7076094, 1075924, 109227, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of the light.</td>', 'Beautiful capture of the light.', '2013-07-23 17:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7076095, 1075901, 109227, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tones.</td>', 'Wonderful tones.', '2013-07-23 17:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7076114, 1075446, 113591, '<td valign="top">Seen it before somewhere, still brilliantly done.<br/> <br/> <br/>What are the neighbours going to say.<br/>Beau has burned out too quickly, as usual, and now Chick is as cold as steel.  hehe</td>', 'Seen it before somewhere, still brilliantly done.  What are the neighbours going to say.Beau has burned out too quickly, as usual, and now Chick is as cold as steel.  hehe', '2013-07-23 18:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7076115, 1075879, 113591, '<td valign="top">Good title<br/>I get drawn into the image by your setup.<br/>The strangeness is it''s strength.<br/>So real and unreal, and somehow connected.</td>', 'Good titleI get drawn into the image by your setup.The strangeness is it''s strength.So real and unreal, and somehow connected.', '2013-07-23 18:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7076119, 1075915, 50641, '<td valign="top">thank you so much for being ridiculous</td>', 'thank you so much for being ridiculous', '2013-07-23 18:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7076173, 1075861, 152252, '<td valign="top">Neat? I love the tones and the dramatic movement effect. Great job.</td>', 'Neat? I love the tones and the dramatic movement effect. Great job.', '2013-07-23 21:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7076181, 1075506, 12611, '<td valign="top">Elements of suburban life exposed. We are constantly greeting and leaving each other, so much rushing around that our true selves are replaced by faded apparitions, always coming and going, leaving and waiving and greeting and au-revoir-ing. <br/> <br/>On a visual level, very nice compositional lines, the garage, the car window, a nice shot of the woods. Goodbye it is.</td>', 'Elements of suburban life exposed. We are constantly greeting and leaving each other, so much rushing around that our true selves are replaced by faded apparitions, always coming and going, leaving and waiving and greeting and au-revoir-ing.  On a visual level, very nice compositional lines, the garage, the car window, a nice shot of the woods. Goodbye it is.', '2013-07-23 21:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7076182, 1075861, 76335, '<td valign="top">A dreamscape. The feeling of running or pursuing, even though our striped-shirt subject appears to be in no hurry. Feels like we''ll never catch up -- and that it will indeed never end.</td>', 'A dreamscape. The feeling of running or pursuing, even though our striped-shirt subject appears to be in no hurry. Feels like we''ll never catch up -- and that it will indeed never end.', '2013-07-23 22:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7076183, 1075703, 76335, '<td valign="top">Poetic.</td>', 'Poetic.', '2013-07-23 22:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7076184, 1075866, 76335, '<td valign="top">Quirky for sure, and one that I could like more with each look. The odd foliage, twisted bicycle, and rustic bench tease and please the eye. The cool earthy tones are pleasing.</td>', 'Quirky for sure, and one that I could like more with each look. The odd foliage, twisted bicycle, and rustic bench tease and please the eye. The cool earthy tones are pleasing.', '2013-07-23 22:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7076185, 1075950, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like that it doesn''t conform to the frame; I might have been tempted to force into a thirds-grid. The pattern of the rug and the pattern of the light seem at odds. The burnt colors and the itchy fibers add further -- well, tension.</td>', 'I like that it doesn''t conform to the frame; I might have been tempted to force into a thirds-grid. The pattern of the rug and the pattern of the light seem at odds. The burnt colors and the itchy fibers add further -- well, tension.', '2013-07-23 22:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7076186, 1075938, 76335, '<td valign="top">An oddity for sure. The way the column of light hits the steer (?) skull, the flooded or floorless room, the featureless three-dimensional space. If not composed, it''s one hell of a find. Metaphors abound.</td>', 'An oddity for sure. The way the column of light hits the steer (?) skull, the flooded or floorless room, the featureless three-dimensional space. If not composed, it''s one hell of a find. Metaphors abound.', '2013-07-23 22:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7076187, 1075273, 76335, '<td valign="top">It''s a smartly composed graphic composition. What''s striking is the contrast between the cluttered left side and empty right side. More striking is that this completely haphazard arrangement somehow feels perfect -- as though changing or moving any one thing would make it fall apart. The sickly yellow-green is relieved only by some splatters of red on the left side. The self deprecating title, in spite of itself, makes us look longer, harder. This is right up my alley. I like it a lot.</td>', 'It''s a smartly composed graphic composition. What''s striking is the contrast between the cluttered left side and empty right side. More striking is that this completely haphazard arrangement somehow feels perfect -- as though changing or moving any one thing would make it fall apart. The sickly yellow-green is relieved only by some splatters of red on the left side. The self deprecating title, in spite of itself, makes us look longer, harder. This is right up my alley. I like it a lot.', '2013-07-23 22:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7076188, 1075852, 76335, '<td valign="top">A strain of the imagination is hardly necessary to see what''s left of the troll being held up for sacrifice -- about to be tossed into the charred heap. It''s an image of hell, and I love it. I think the cinematic aspect ratio costs it some impact here (on any computer screen actually), but a crop would ruin it. It needs its own wall, where it would do nothing less than transfix and transform the viewer. Astounding work. My top pick.</td>', 'A strain of the imagination is hardly necessary to see what''s left of the troll being held up for sacrifice -- about to be tossed into the charred heap. It''s an image of hell, and I love it. I think the cinematic aspect ratio costs it some impact here (on any computer screen actually), but a crop would ruin it. It needs its own wall, where it would do nothing less than transfix and transform the viewer. Astounding work. My top pick.', '2013-07-23 22:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7076189, 1075433, 76335, '<td valign="top">Chaotic and full of possibilities.</td>', 'Chaotic and full of possibilities.', '2013-07-23 22:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7076190, 1075271, 76335, '<td valign="top">The shadowy lamppost bows to the empty window. Not only nice in black and white, but necessary.</td>', 'The shadowy lamppost bows to the empty window. Not only nice in black and white, but necessary.', '2013-07-23 22:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7076191, 1075297, 76335, '<td valign="top">Insects on the moon? I like the electric blues.</td>', 'Insects on the moon? I like the electric blues.', '2013-07-23 22:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7076192, 1075900, 76335, '<td valign="top">There''s a terrific metaphor here, that I haven''t yet found, but I feel the revelation will be worth the effort.</td>', 'There''s a terrific metaphor here, that I haven''t yet found, but I feel the revelation will be worth the effort.', '2013-07-23 22:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7076193, 1075799, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love flowers in monochrome -- stripped of their color, we''re forced to focus on their (often) grotesque figures and forms. And so much the better when that means the flower takes on a new identity altogether. This lily has thorns!</td>', 'I love flowers in monochrome -- stripped of their color, we''re forced to focus on their (often) grotesque figures and forms. And so much the better when that means the flower takes on a new identity altogether. This lily has thorns!', '2013-07-23 22:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7076194, 1075932, 76335, '<td valign="top">Living room bliss. A ten from me.</td>', 'Living room bliss. A ten from me.', '2013-07-23 22:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7076196, 1075945, 76335, '<td valign="top">The fantastic beauty of this will be lost on most viewers. Their loss means that I don''t have to share it. One of my top picks. Such poetry.</td>', 'The fantastic beauty of this will be lost on most viewers. Their loss means that I don''t have to share it. One of my top picks. Such poetry.', '2013-07-23 22:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7076197, 1075873, 161988, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.</td>', 'This is very nice.', '2013-07-23 22:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7076198, 1075906, 76335, '<td valign="top">The dark golden hues and large sweeping brushstrokes suggest a sunset. And sunsets are beautiful. Or are they? This one is left up to the viewer. Is this a warm beach, illuminated by the last rays of the setting sun? Or do we have the sun penetrating a charred post-apocalyptic wasteland? It depends on one''s mood, I suppose. This would make a remarkable painting, but it''s (presumably) not a painting at all. So what an eye and what an imagination the photographer who found and extracted this must have. And while I don''t usually put a lot of stock into titles, this one intrigued me.</td>', 'The dark golden hues and large sweeping brushstrokes suggest a sunset. And sunsets are beautiful. Or are they? This one is left up to the viewer. Is this a warm beach, illuminated by the last rays of the setting sun? Or do we have the sun penetrating a charred post-apocalyptic wasteland? It depends on one''s mood, I suppose. This would make a remarkable painting, but it''s (presumably) not a painting at all. So what an eye and what an imagination the photographer who found and extracted this must have. And while I don''t usually put a lot of stock into titles, this one intrigued me.', '2013-07-23 22:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7076200, 1075912, 76335, '<td valign="top">Step away and you''ll miss the light show. Beautiful.</td>', 'Step away and you''ll miss the light show. Beautiful.', '2013-07-23 22:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
