(7076290, 1075799, 100831, '<td valign="top">I like flowers in monochrome because then it can be any color I want it to be. This flower is becoming almost unplant-like...the darks are ominous and sparks are flying. I''d say it''s color is within the crimson family.</td>', 'I like flowers in monochrome because then it can be any color I want it to be. This flower is becoming almost unplant-like...the darks are ominous and sparks are flying. I''d say it''s color is within the crimson family.', '2013-07-24 00:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7076292, 1075762, 64086, '<td valign="top">Mysterious science experiment, torture chamber or witchcraft. Lovely deep blacks and bright whites. A touch of reality mixed with abstract shapes blended in darkness. Fascinating to look at.  An extraordinary masterpiece made from the ordinary.</td>', 'Mysterious science experiment, torture chamber or witchcraft. Lovely deep blacks and bright whites. A touch of reality mixed with abstract shapes blended in darkness. Fascinating to look at.  An extraordinary masterpiece made from the ordinary.', '2013-07-24 00:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
