(7076342, 1075949, 65319, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this image, I was reminded of the character "Walter" in the TV show, Fringe.  The extraction of three pieces of his brain tissue created gaps in his memory, yet his mind remained a steel trap of pure eccentric genius.  Does this image carry a shrapnel of his memory waiting for a chance to reconnect and "speak"?  My goodness...I do hope so!  How lucky you are to have the secret.</td>', 'When I first saw this image, I was reminded of the character "Walter" in the TV show, Fringe.  The extraction of three pieces of his brain tissue created gaps in his memory, yet his mind remained a steel trap of pure eccentric genius.  Does this image carry a shrapnel of his memory waiting for a chance to reconnect and "speak"?  My goodness...I do hope so!  How lucky you are to have the secret.', '2013-07-24 01:50:59.000000', NULL, 0),
