(7076740, 1075841, 65319, '<td valign="top">Tuning into the music of the spheres from some celestial radio, the sense of vast infinity humbles my sense of human ego yet expands and opens my inner doors perhaps to both imaginable and unimagined worlds. As the fleeting star in your image boldly goes, I, too, must follow my own star and pick this one as my very favorite in this challenge (for whatever that is worth...;-)...). For here, I discover the nesting place of Bennu where my sense of trust and renewal in the universe resounds. I admire that you entered it and wish I had the skill and courage to make such an image and do the same. Thank you! <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-07-25 15:14:44.</i></td>', 'Tuning into the music of the spheres from some celestial radio, the sense of vast infinity humbles my sense of human ego yet expands and opens my inner doors perhaps to both imaginable and unimagined worlds. As the fleeting star in your image boldly goes, I, too, must follow my own star and pick this one as my very favorite in this challenge (for whatever that is worth...;-)...). For here, I discover the nesting place of Bennu where my sense of trust and renewal in the universe resounds. I admire that you entered it and wish I had the skill and courage to make such an image and do the same. Thank you! ', '2013-07-25 01:55:07.000000', '2013-07-25 16:14:44.000000', 0),
(7076752, 1075906, 119419, '<td valign="top">In reality I''d say this is your floorboards, but in art, it is wonderful. A mesmerizing piece, can''t say I didn''t struggle with it at first, but it has the x factor gene in the chemical makeup, and as mere mortals we must succumb to it''s hypnotic power.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-07-25 03:28:10.</i></td>', 'In reality I''d say this is your floorboards, but in art, it is wonderful. A mesmerizing piece, can''t say I didn''t struggle with it at first, but it has the x factor gene in the chemical makeup, and as mere mortals we must succumb to it''s hypnotic power.', '2013-07-25 02:24:21.000000', '2013-07-25 04:28:10.000000', 0),
