(7076769, 1075836, 112828, '<td valign="top">It''s the cat, that makes it for me.<br/> <br/>The composition and general look brought me in, the topaz almost turned me away, but then I found the cat.  Then a dozen crosses.  Then so much more.  It''s pretty awesome this one.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-07-25 02:32:53.</i></td>', 'It''s the cat, that makes it for me. The composition and general look brought me in, the topaz almost turned me away, but then I found the cat.  Then a dozen crosses.  Then so much more.  It''s pretty awesome this one.', '2013-07-25 03:31:40.000000', '2013-07-25 03:32:53.000000', 0),
