(7076898, 1075635, 90414, '<td valign="top">Thank you to the jury for the inclusion of this photo in your Fine Art III awards. I feel honored. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=859849" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/52336/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_859849.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/52336/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_859849.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/52336/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_859849.png"/></a></td>', 'Thank you to the jury for the inclusion of this photo in your Fine Art III awards. I feel honored. ', '2013-07-25 15:58:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(7076906, 1075762, 65319, '<td valign="top">Such an ordinary creature yet linked to the greater mysteries of alchemy and elemental fire. Like a genie in a bottle, he''s yearning to be free from the shroud of shadow and light. "Untitled" perhaps, but trapped on a brink leaves no doubt that position in life is all. I am not magical or mythical, but somehow I know the feeling of the brink quite well. 10</td>', 'Such an ordinary creature yet linked to the greater mysteries of alchemy and elemental fire. Like a genie in a bottle, he''s yearning to be free from the shroud of shadow and light. "Untitled" perhaps, but trapped on a brink leaves no doubt that position in life is all. I am not magical or mythical, but somehow I know the feeling of the brink quite well. 10', '2013-07-25 16:25:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7076909, 1075861, 65319, '<td valign="top">A question without a question mark. And so the torrid love affair between the question and the answer begins. I''m enthralled. Hmmm...I did waffle about that empty space on the right though.  Congrats on Top 10 and I gave it a 10!</td>', 'A question without a question mark. And so the torrid love affair between the question and the answer begins. I''m enthralled. Hmmm...I did waffle about that empty space on the right though.  Congrats on Top 10 and I gave it a 10!', '2013-07-25 16:31:56.000000', NULL, 0),
